# Themis — environment variable NAMES only. Never commit values.
#
# Browser (Vite inlines these into the PUBLIC bundle; src/lib/env.ts is the only reader, P2.2).
# Both unset = LOCAL-ONLY mode: the app is the client-side decision matrix, no backend, no
# request. CI and the live site currently build this way. Set BOTH to enable Supabase: the
# project URL and its ANON (publishable) key. Never the service-role key: check:bundle fails on it.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#
# `npm run db:apply` (P1.11) — the Management-API migration applier. Operator-only: export these
# in the shell for the apply session; db:apply reads the environment and never a .env file.
# SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# THEMIS_SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF=
